<title>POLAND: INDYKPOL TO PAY PLN 3.0 MLN FOR MEAT FIRM.</title>
<headline>INDYKPOL TO PAY PLN 3.0 MLN FOR MEAT FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish poultry producer Indykpol SA is likely to buy a meet processing firm Zaklady Miesne Przedsiebiorstwo Panstwowe w Olsztynie for three million zlotys from the state treasury, Indykpol said.</p>
<p>Indykpol said in a Tuesday statement it had signed an initial agreement on buying the firm and said its committments included five-million-zloty investments in the firm in the next five years.</p>
<p>It did not give any other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
